    <h2>Human-review rule</h2>
    <p>The AI should flag indicators and organize evidence. It should not infer protected identity, make final bias findings, or determine personnel consequences. Type 2 complaints require contextual evidence; Type 4 content requires immediate escalation outside ordinary SET summaries.</p>
  </div>
</section>

